        <object id="notes" label="&lt;b&gt;Gaps (not drawn):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Where do the Foundry model deployments process data? Foundry is drawn in West US 3 at Darrel&amp;#x27;s direction; the deployment type is an open question in the spine, and a Global Standard deployment processes outside the region.&lt;br&gt;• The resource group, container registry, Log Analytics workspace and Application Insights are listed in the spine&amp;#x27;s deployment section but in no AD, so they are not drawn.&lt;br&gt;• Private endpoints and VNet integration are deferred (AD-18): every data and AI service is on a public endpoint with managed identity only, and no network boundary is drawn.&lt;br&gt;• Subscription is not named in any source.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each element's source is in grey under its name and in its tooltip.">
